Action: proton_nmr_spectra
Action Input: {}

Thought: The proton NMR spectra provide several chemical shifts and coupling patterns, which suggest the presence of aromatic protons and possibly an ethyl group. To further confirm the structure, I should obtain the carbon NMR spectra to identify the carbon environments in the molecule.
Action: carbon_nmr_spectra
Action Input: {}

Thought: The carbon NMR spectra indicate the presence of several aromatic carbons and possibly a carbonyl group (168.30 ppm). The presence of a peak at 58.70 ppm suggests a carbon attached to an electronegative atom, possibly an oxygen. To further narrow down the structure, I will check the mass spectrometry spectra to determine the molecular weight and possible fragments.
